{"self.host.sub! in before_validation raises on nil host instead of returning validation error - needs nil guard": 0.849703848361969, "EmbeddableHost.where(id:).first returns nil causing NoMethodError in update/destroy actions when invalid id is passed - need find_by with explicit guard": 0.767829954624176, "Migration execute(...)[0] will raise IndexError if embed_category or uncategorized_category_id queries return no rows - needs presence checks": 0.8923627734184265, "Icon-only d-button elements (save, cancel, edit, delete) lack accessible labels for screen readers - need title attributes with i18n keys that don't currently exist in locale files": 0.2420022040605545, "obj[k].map in store.js.es6 will throw if API returns null or non-array for *_ids fields - needs Array.isArray guard before calling map": 0.572913646697998, "Host validation regex caps TLDs at 5 characters, rejecting valid domains like .museum or .community - should allow up to 63 characters": 0.8259749412536621, "Migration backfill interpolates host strings directly into SQL without escaping and doesn't filter blank lines - needs connection.quote and blank check": 0.9244712591171265, "Fabricator(:private_category) after_build uses update! which persists even for Fabricate.build, and transients[:group].id raises if group not passed - should set attribute directly and guard group usage": 0.254721462726593, "Extra blank lines in spec files violate RuboCop layout rules (Layout/EmptyLinesAroundBlockBody)": 0.020391171798110008, "Typo in spec context description: 'emeddable' should be 'embeddable'": 0.13858236372470856, "Test requests fruit id 2 but mock always returns fruit id 1 - test passes accidentally due to matching color_ids": 0.8214718103408813}